        "original_id": "9cecdaf3-d65c-50f0-97ee-ce596070a615",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Dennis Publishing, John Brown Publishing, I Feel Good Publishing, Dennis Digital\n- Publications: Bizarre, Fortean Times, WAD magazine, VICE UK, INSIDE artzine, Maxim, Stuff, The Week, Blender\n- People: Charles Fort, Bob Basset\n- Topics: anomalous phenomena\n\nFacts:\n- Bizarre was a British alternative magazine published from 1997 to 2015.\n- Fortean Times was published by John Brown Publishing from 1991 to 2001.\n- Fortean Times was published by I Feel Good Publishing from 2001 to 2005.\n- Fortean Times is a British monthly magazine devoted to anomalous phenomena popularised by Charles Fort.\n- Bizarre was published by Dennis Publishing and was a sister publication to Fortean Times.\n- Fortean Times is now published by Dennis Publishing Ltd.\n- Publications about Bob Basset appeared in WAD magazine, VICE UK, Bizarre magazine, and INSIDE artzine magazine.\n- Dennis Digital is the interactive Internet and mobile division of Dennis Publishing.\n- Dennis Publishing publishes Maxim, Stuff, and The Week.\n- Dennis Publishing formerly published the now defunct Blender.",
